{"id":9122,"date":"2025-12-02T08:29:07","date_gmt":"2025-12-02T11:29:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/luancarvalho.com.br\/?page_id=9122"},"modified":"2025-12-02T22:41:35","modified_gmt":"2025-12-03T01:41:35","slug":"parceiros","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/luancarvalho.com.br\/parceiros\/","title":{"rendered":"Parceiros"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"9122\" class=\"elementor elementor-9122\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b061897 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b061897\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24addf9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"24addf9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"lp-partners\">\r\n  <div class=\"lp-frame\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- CUPONS -->\r\n    <section class=\"lp-section\">\r\n      <h2>CUPONS<\/h2>\r\n\r\n      <!-- PRINCIPIUM -->\r\n      <article class=\"lp-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"lp-card-content\">\r\n          <div class=\"lp-card-header\">\r\n            <div class=\"lp-card-title-group\">\r\n              <h3 class=\"lp-title-main\">PRINCIPIUM<\/h3>\r\n              <p class=\"lp-card-subtitle\">\r\n                MANIPULADOS + CARAMELO DE CREATINA\r\n              <\/p>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n\r\n          <p class=\"lp-card-text\">\r\n            \u00c9 a farm\u00e1cia onde eu manipulo todo o meu projeto de shape: cabelo, imunidade, vitaminas e sa\u00fade em geral.\r\n            Meu cupom vale pro site inteiro, principalmente pro <b>caramelo de creatina<\/b> que eu tanto falo que me ajuda na dieta.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"lp-card-footer lp-card-footer-coupon\">\r\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/www.principium.com.br\/linha-propria-principium\/caramelo-de-creatina\"\r\n               target=\"_blank\" class=\"lp-button lp-button-dark\">\r\n              Ir para o site\r\n            <\/a>\r\n            <span class=\"lp-button lp-button-red\">\r\n              Cupom: <strong>LUAN10<\/strong>\r\n            <\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/article>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PROFISSIONAIS -->\r\n    <section class=\"lp-section lp-section-prof\">\r\n      <h2>PROFISSIONAIS<\/h2>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 1\u00ba: Coach \/ Nutri -->\r\n      <article class=\"lp-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"lp-card-content\">\r\n          <div class=\"lp-card-header lp-card-header-simple\">\r\n            <div class=\"lp-card-title-group lp-card-title-full\">\r\n              <h3 class=\"lp-title-main\">COACH \/ NUTRI<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <p class=\"lp-card-text\">\r\n            Foi o \u00fanico cara em 27 anos que fez meu shape virar realidade de verdade.\r\n            Mentor de alta performance, nutri\u00e7\u00e3o, bem-estar, e nerd de treino. Focado em resultado real, sem maluquice.\r\n            Segue ele pra entender melhor.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n          <div class=\"lp-card-footer\">\r\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/theguiribeiro\/\"\r\n               target=\"_blank\" class=\"lp-button lp-button-dark\">\r\n              Ver Instagram\r\n            <\/a>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/article>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 2\u00ba: Psic\u00f3logo \/ Hipnose -->\r\n      <article class=\"lp-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"lp-card-content\">\r\n          <div class=\"lp-card-header lp-card-header-simple\">\r\n            <div class=\"lp-card-title-group lp-card-title-full\">\r\n              <h3 class=\"lp-title-main lp-title-long\">PSIC\u00d3LOGO \/ HIPNOSE<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <p class=\"lp-card-text\">\r\n            Psic\u00f3logo e hipnoterapeuta que me ajudou a encarar meus traumas.\r\n            Especialista em v\u00edcios, ansiedade e depress\u00e3o.\r\n            Se voc\u00ea prefere enfrentar todos os le\u00f5es de uma vez em vez de sofrer um por dia, come\u00e7a por aqui.\r\n            Atende online.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n          <div class=\"lp-card-footer\">\r\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/psicologolionelfloreshipnose\/\"\r\n               target=\"_blank\" class=\"lp-button lp-button-dark\">\r\n              Ver Instagram\r\n            <\/a>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/article>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 3\u00ba: Psiquiatra -->\r\n      <article class=\"lp-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"lp-card-content\">\r\n          <div class=\"lp-card-header lp-card-header-simple\">\r\n            <div class=\"lp-card-title-group lp-card-title-full\">\r\n              <h3 class=\"lp-title-main\">PSIQUIATRA<\/h3>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <p class=\"lp-card-text\">\r\n            Psiquiatra e neurocientista que cuida da \u201cqu\u00edmica\u201d do meu c\u00e9rebro e me acompanha no tratamento do TDAH.\r\n            Me ajuda a organizar as ideias, manter o foco e proteger minha sa\u00fade mental pra eu aguentar o ritmo que eu levo.\r\n          <\/p>\r\n          <div class=\"lp-card-footer\">\r\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/edgarlaborne\/\"\r\n               target=\"_blank\" class=\"lp-button lp-button-dark\">\r\n              Ver Instagram\r\n            <\/a>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/article>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n    <!-- TEXTO FINAL -->\r\n    <section class=\"lp-section\">\r\n      <p class=\"lp-bottom-text\">\r\n        Aqui eu junto tudo que realmente uso: cupons de desconto e a equipe que cuida\r\n        da minha mente, da minha sa\u00fade e do meu shape. Se voc\u00ea curte meu resultado,\r\n        come\u00e7a por aqui.\r\n      <\/p>\r\n    <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n  :root {\r\n    --lp-grey: #F1F1F17D;\r\n    --lp-red: #ce0000;\r\n    --lp-white: #ffffff;\r\n    --lp-black: #000000;\r\n    --lp-card-bg: #151921CC;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-partners {\r\n    padding: 32px 0 48px;\r\n    font-family: \"Poppins\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\",\r\n      Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Noto Sans\", sans-serif;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-frame {\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    max-width: 100%;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-section {\r\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n    padding: 0 16px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-section h2 {\r\n    font-size: 16px;\r\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    text-transform: uppercase;\r\n    color: var(--lp-red);\r\n    font-family: \"Poppins\", sans-serif;\r\n    font-weight: 700; \/* agora em negrito *\/\r\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-section-prof {\r\n    margin-top: 8px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/* CARDS *\/\r\n  .lp-card {\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    margin-top: 10px;\r\n    border-radius: 20px;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    border: none;\r\n    background: var(--lp-card-bg);\r\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-card-content {\r\n    padding: 18px 18px 14px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-card-header {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: flex-start;\r\n    align-items: flex-start;\r\n    gap: 12px;\r\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\r\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(241, 241, 241, 0.16);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-card-header-simple {\r\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-card-title-group {\r\n    max-width: 75%;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-card-title-full {\r\n    max-width: 100%;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .lp-title-main {\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    font-size: 24px;\r\n    line-height: 1.15;